{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>水上遊覽服務提供商瘦西湖文旅，今日起招股，入場費約5,121元。</p><p></p><p>每股招股價最高5.07元，發售4,476萬股H股，當中一成本港發售，餘額國際發售，集資最多逾2.26億元。下周二截止認購，下周五掛牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:03.069962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:07.968141+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:07.968141+00:00","content_hash":"a133879319f6fed848e70e9c9eac5ab328420ab50e13da34c961b9e34d36292b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}